      "t": "Pulling Kostya aside in the hallway, Nastya is furious that he wants to go out drinking at karaoke with a homeless man instead of staying home with her. When Kostya defends Rodion as their new friend, an exasperated Nastya marches back into the kitchen and tells Rodion Sergeyevich that he has to leave.",
      "gap": 0.8
